      "text": "A comms room is often a cupboard with a rack in it. It is also the single point of failure for a whole office or site. A regular physical inspection catches the slow problems: a clogged filter, a UPS past its battery life, a temperature creeping up, a rat's nest of patch leads. Catch them on a walk-round, not after an outage."
